  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/3063a971-4efa-4852-8b64-0bc41e6b2897\" alt=\"\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KGzi90W.png\" width=\"689\" height=\"320\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"123\" height=\"33\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>免責聲明：本附加模組專為 Creeper Overhaul 資源包設計，並非遊戲模組！&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a> 為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Overhaul 資源包</a> 設計的附加模組&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-需搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Overhaul RP</a> 使用 -</strong><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jJoDs5r.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"284\" height=\"128\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>資源包載入順序：</strong></strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wt0XlhF.png\" width=\"438\" height=\"283\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"165\" height=\"33\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>&nbsp;</span>GogoMines - 負責資源包製作</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">FreshLX - 負責動畫製作</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Joosh - Creeper Overhaul</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"420\" height=\"33\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-mob-models\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Better Mob Models</strong></a> - 採用 joosh 畫風，全面翻新原版生物模型與貼圖的資源包</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Overhaul RP</a> - 將 Creeper Overhaul 苦力怕融入原版 Minecraft 的資源包！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DErXjx6.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W758n8u.png\"></strong></p>",
